        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hampton Del Ruth, Ted Kotcheff, Alfred J. Goulding, Harry McCoy, Earle Rodney, Mack Sennett\n- Works: Girl Crazy (1929 film), Armchair Theatre\n- Roles: film actor, director, screenwriter, producer, television director\n- Topics: film and television careers, story credits\n\nFacts:\n- Hampton Del Ruth was born on September 7, 1879, and died on May 15, 1958.\n- Hampton Del Ruth was an American film actor, director, screenwriter, and film producer.\n- Ted Kotcheff was born William Theodore Kotcheff on April 7, 1931, as Velichko Todorov Tsochev.\n- Ted Kotcheff is a Bulgarian-Canadian film and television director and producer.\n- Ted Kotcheff is known primarily for high-profile British and American television productions such as Armchair Theatre.\n- The 1929 film Girl Crazy credited its story to Hampton Del Ruth, Alfred J. Goulding, Harry McCoy, Earle Rodney, and Mack Sennett.",
